{
    "title": "Jumanji: Epic Run",
    "description": "Welcome to Jumanji!\r\nOnce again, Jumanji is in peril. The sacred Falcon Jewel has been stolen, and you\u2019re on the fun run to recover it in this action-packed running game adventure. \r\nRun from howling hyenas, climb mountains, avoid avalanches, jump and free-fall from deadly waterfalls, and defeat anyone in your way. \r\nAvoid dangerous animals from the game, including rhinos, vultures, jaguars, and more ... watch out at all times! \r\nPlay this all-new 4D Runner Game and save JUMANJI! Join forces with the Rock or other captivating characters as you race against time to save the magical world from peril!\r\nLess talk, more running. Now\u2026 GO GO!\r\n \r\n \r\n4 WAYS TO PLAY THE GAME: A whole new kind of runner with 4 epic, next-level game modes set in the world of Jumanji. Choose to play as the Rock or one of the other captivating characters and embark on an extraordinary adventure. Charge forward and fight your enemies, run from animal stampedes, climb perilous cliffs, and dive off massive waterfalls. Fun run, jump, duck, dash, slide and keep running to reclaim the sacred jewel!\r\n \r\nEPIC ENVIRONMENTS: Unlock thrillingly dangerous new environments as you play this adventure game: The Jungle, The Oasis, The Dunes, and Mt. Zhatmire. \r\n \r\nSELECT YOUR AVATAR: Running is more fun when you can choose your character for a fun run. Play as The Rock aka Dr. Smolder Bravestone, Franklin \u201cMouse\u201d Finbar, Ruby Roundhouse, or Professor Shelly Oberon.\r\n \r\nMAD SKILLS: Take advantage of each character\u2019s special skills: hurl boomerangs, dance, fight with nunchucks, trailblaze with geometric calculations, jump to the highest heights, or ride jungle animals like a boss.\r\n \r\nDEADLY JUNGLE BATTLES: Defeat giant brutes and other fearsome enemies. Don\u2019t let anyone get in your way!\r\n \r\nENDLESS TREASURES: Collect power-ups as you race and jump along the perilous running path.\r\n \r\nMagnet- collects all nearby gold bars.\r\nShield - protects you from obstacles\r\nGold Doubler - double your gold bar pickups to get ahead in the game with gold run\r\n \r\nSTYLE UP: You can\u2019t fun run and jump without the right look! Unlock new environments and get amazing outfits. Each outfit grants you a bonus for each power-up you collect in the game.     \r\n \r\nJoin forces with the Rock and unleash your inner adventure in an exhilarating journey filled with challenges, excitement, and epic rewards! Are you ready for the Next Level?!\r\n \r\nJumanji: Epic Run \u2122 & \u00a9 2019 Columbia Pictures Industries, Inc. All Rights Reserved. Published by Crazy Labs Ltd. Software excluding Columbia Pictures elements \u00a9 2019 Crazy Labs Ltd. Developed by PlaySide Studios Pty Ltd.\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit our Privacy Policy: https://www.crazylabs.com/apps-privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Jumanji!<br>Once again, Jumanji is in peril. The sacred Falcon Jewel has been stolen, and you\u2019re on the fun run to recover it in this action-packed running game adventure. <br>Run from howling hyenas, climb mountains, avoid avalanches, jump and free-fall from deadly waterfalls, and defeat anyone in your way. <br>Avoid dangerous animals from the game, including rhinos, vultures, jaguars, and more ... watch out at all times! <br>Play this all-new 4D Runner Game and save JUMANJI! Join forces with the Rock or other captivating characters as you race against time to save the magical world from peril!<br>Less talk, more running. Now\u2026 GO GO!<br> <br> <br>4 WAYS TO PLAY THE GAME: A whole new kind of runner with 4 epic, next-level game modes set in the world of Jumanji. Choose to play as the Rock or one of the other captivating characters and embark on an extraordinary adventure. Charge forward and fight your enemies, run from animal stampedes, climb perilous cliffs, and dive off massive waterfalls. Fun run, jump, duck, dash, slide and keep running to reclaim the sacred jewel!<br> <br>EPIC ENVIRONMENTS: Unlock thrillingly dangerous new environments as you play this adventure game: The Jungle, The Oasis, The Dunes, and Mt. Zhatmire. <br> <br>SELECT YOUR AVATAR: Running is more fun when you can choose your character for a fun run. Play as The Rock aka Dr. Smolder Bravestone, Franklin \u201cMouse\u201d Finbar, Ruby Roundhouse, or Professor Shelly Oberon.<br> <br>MAD SKILLS: Take advantage of each character\u2019s special skills: hurl boomerangs, dance, fight with nunchucks, trailblaze with geometric calculations, jump to the highest heights, or ride jungle animals like a boss.<br> <br>DEADLY JUNGLE BATTLES: Defeat giant brutes and other fearsome enemies. Don\u2019t let anyone get in your way!<br> <br>ENDLESS TREASURES: Collect power-ups as you race and jump along the perilous running path.<br> <br>Magnet- collects all nearby gold bars.<br>Shield - protects you from obstacles<br>Gold Doubler - double your gold bar pickups to get ahead in the game with gold run<br> <br>STYLE UP: You can\u2019t fun run and jump without the right look! Unlock new environments and get amazing outfits. Each outfit grants you a bonus for each power-up you collect in the game.     <br> <br>Join forces with the Rock and unleash your inner adventure in an exhilarating journey filled with challenges, excitement, and epic rewards! Are you ready for the Next Level?!<br> <br>Jumanji: Epic Run \u2122 &amp; \u00a9 2019 Columbia Pictures Industries, Inc. All Rights Reserved. Published by Crazy Labs Ltd. Software excluding Columbia Pictures elements \u00a9 2019 Crazy Labs Ltd. Developed by PlaySide Studios Pty Ltd.<br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit our Privacy Policy: https://www.crazylabs.com/apps-privacy-policy/",
